      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BOOM SMACKING (8) turned in a modest effort most recently when fifth at this track over 380m behind Add A Zero (22.57) in a Restricted WIN. Has ability and looks hard to stop. TWEED DREAM (4) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (20.29) at Capalaba. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from four starts. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. MOUSTACHE MICK (2) showed little early speed at his last couple, the latest finishing fourth (22.41) in a Grade 4/5 at this track. Cannot be taken lightly. FEDERAL ROCKET (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
